    "notes": "Q2733427 and OSM relation 1225220 identify the wall. Its inner and outer outlines and the road intersections at all ten named gates fix the signed placement. The second replaced building part overlaps the mapped wall footprint by over 99 percent. Deck grades and arch dimensions are reconstructed from the mapped circuit, available terrain and exterior views. The station stair is fitted on the town side of its mapped path. The two wall outlines and mapped passages establish placement. Individual masonry repairs and other stair flights are outside the model scope. Physical-device timings are unmeasured."
  },
